# CES-005 – product catalogue: view, add a product, withdraw a product

Start /catalogue
Scope /catalogue
Exclude /prototype /prototype-admin /assets
Tags catalogue CES-005

--- Setup ---

Use setup.tech-admin

--- Map ---

Visit /catalogue
Visit /catalogue/p1
ClickLink "withdraw product"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
ClickButton "withdraw product"
Wait 1200
Snapshot

# Add a product
Goto /catalogue
ClickLink "add a product"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
FillIn "product name" with "DTx product E"
FillIn "Version" with "1.0"
Check "Pathway 1"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Fill "#conditionName" "Asthma"
Fill "#indication-0" "Indication E1"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Choose "No"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
ClickButton "save product"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
